I can't show it to you because it has people's information on it, but essentially what it pulls up is my next screen, which says all of the people that I've referred and what their status is.

149
00:09:00,795 --> 00:09:10,863
It also gives me a breakdown of when exactly Care Solace talked to the person that I referred, who they've tried to contact for an appointment and when and what the method was.

