195
00:13:07,657 --> 00:13:12,101
So you can see the larger agencies here, North Shore, mental health.

196
00:13:13,230 --> 00:13:17,356
Family Counseling Associates, Cora Spillman has taken quite a few.

197
00:13:18,197 --> 00:13:23,825
Trinity Care, the larger agencies are more likely to be accepting people, which is of no surprise.

198
00:13:24,046 --> 00:13:27,751
If you have more providers, you are more likely to have appointments down the line.

199
00:13:29,304 --> 00:13:35,465
And then I'm not surprised by what they're referring for in terms of mental health.

200
00:13:35,545 --> 00:13:38,966
Anxiety is gonna be our top contender these days.

201
00:13:39,126 --> 00:13:40,766
