230
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:12,024
It's like they're coming back and saying, hey, we have an appointment, Stacey, for you at 10 AM on a Wednesday.

231
00:16:12,044 --> 00:16:16,767
And I'm saying, I can't do that because of my job, too.

232
00:16:16,887 --> 00:16:19,249
So that's another challenge that we're seeing.

